This prompt addresses a major limitation in current LLMs where Angular applications are often generated using outdated module-based architecture despite modern Angular versions adopting standalone APIs. The prompt explicitly aligns the model with Angular 17+ architectural patterns such as `bootstrapApplication()`, `app.config.ts`, provider-based configuration, and module-free application structure. It reduces legacy Angular hallucinations like `app.module.ts`, improves architectural consistency, and enables the LLM to generate modern enterprise-ready Angular scaffolds that match current Angular CLI behavior and ecosystem standards.
